It should also be directly surrounded by an Nwell guard ring
(Non broken NCOMP ring inside Nwelll).
Nwell guard ring shall be connected to the most positive supply.
Max space of Nwell guard ring to the NCOMP in Psub directly
connected to I/O pad = 15
Debug 1 : NCOMP inside Nwell guard ring might be broken or not present
: Unbroken NCOMP will also ensure unbroken Nwell or there will be other violations
Debug 2 : The violating edge is more than 15um away from the Nwell edge
